# Ingest-scoped Axiom API token, for `wrangler dev` only. Production reads a
# secret instead:
#   pnpm --filter @notch/logs exec wrangler secret put AXIOM_TOKEN --env production
#
# This belongs here rather than in apps/api/.dev.vars: the API never reads it,
# the shipper does. Without it the Worker accepts trace events and drops them,
# which is what a local run should do.
AXIOM_TOKEN=""
